<section class="ter-gm-panel"><nav class="ter-tabs"><button type="button" data-tab="tokens" class="active">Token Elements</button><button type="button" data-tab="characters">Character Access</button></nav><div data-panel="tokens"><h2>GM Element Controls</h2><fieldset><legend>Mass Token Elements</legend><p>Uses controlled tokens first; if none are controlled, uses your targeted tokens.</p><div class="ter-two"><label>Element<select name="massElement">{{#each elements}}<option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label>Remove Element<select name="removeElement"><option value="__all">All Elements</option>{{#each elements}}<option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label></div><div class="ter-actions"><button type="button" data-action="mass-apply">Apply Element</button><button type="button" data-action="mass-remove">Remove Element</button></div></fieldset></div><div data-panel="characters" hidden><h2>Player Character Element Access</h2><p>Expand a character and choose which elements that character is allowed to select on their sheet.</p><div class="ter-character-access">{{#each actors}}<details data-actor="{{uuid}}"><summary><strong>{{name}}</strong><span>{{#if infused}}Infusion On{{else}}Infusion Off{{/if}}</span></summary><div class="ter-character-body"><label class="ter-infusion"><input type="checkbox" data-field="infused" {{#if infused}}checked{{/if}}> Infusion enabled</label><label>Current Element<select data-field="element"><option value="">None</option>{{#each ../elements}}<option value="{{id}}" data-id="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><fieldset><legend>Unlocked Elements</legend><div class="ter-unlocks">{{#each ../elements}}<label><input type="checkbox" data-unlock="{{id}}"> {{name}}</label>{{/each}}</div></fieldset></div></details>{{/each}}</div></div></section>